P1 · S8 · 0011 — Automations shared state holder(s)
====================================================

Goal: port web hook domain web/src/api/hooks/useAutomations.ts (12 hooks: 5 reads +
7 mutations) to UI-free KMP shared-core state holders at web-hook parity — same
endpoints, same snake_case params, same query keys/caching intent, same derivations,
SI preserved (conversion is display-only, S5). Delegation FORBIDDEN — implemented in
this session.

Artifacts produced (apps/shared/core):
  commonMain:
    - cache/CacheDomain.kt                                   (+Automations partition, 30s)
    - presentation/automations/AutomationModels.kt          (all DTOs + 3 id-free sealed
                                                              step hierarchies, kind disc.)
    - data/repo/AutomationsRepository.kt                    (S7 port iface + query/key helpers)
    - data/repo/HttpAutomationsRepository.kt                (HTTP impl over CachingRepository<JsonElement>)
    - presentation/automations/AutomationsStore.kt          (S8 state holder; targeted refresh)
  commonTest:
    - presentation/automations/AutomationsStoreTest.kt       (fake-repo behaviour, 9 tests)
    - data/repo/AutomationsRepositoryContractTest.kt         (endpoint/method/body/cache, 17 tests)
    - presentation/automations/AutomationsGoldenTest.kt      (golden vectors, 6 tests)

=== PARITY ===
Reads (5) — cache→network feed, web query key → S7 cache key, params snake_case:
  [x] useAutomations          -> GET  /automations                       key list             decode List<Automation> (safeArray)
  [x] useAutomationHistory    -> GET  /automations/history?limit=N        key history:N        decode AutomationHistoryListResponse
  [x] useAutomation           -> GET  /automations/{id}                   key detail:id        decode AutomationFull (steps + id-free lanes)
  [x] useAutomationPresets    -> GET  /automations/presets[?category=]    key presets[:cat]    decode AutomationPresetsResponse (category sent only when non-empty)
  [x] useAutomationPreset     -> GET  /automations/presets/{id}           key preset:id        decode AutomationPreset
Mutations (7) — suspend Result, store refreshes EXACTLY the web invalidateQueries set:
  [x] useToggleAutomation     -> PATCH  /automations/{id}/toggle {enabled}        invalidate -> list
  [x] useReEnableAutomation   -> PATCH  /automations/{id}/re-enable               invalidate -> list
  [x] useDeleteAutomation     -> DELETE /automations/{id}                         invalidate -> list + history(all limits)
  [x] useBulkAutomationsUpdate-> POST   /automations/bulk {ids,op}                invalidate -> list + history(all limits)
  [x] useTestRunAutomation    -> POST   /automations/{id}/test-run                invalidate -> history(all limits)
  [x] useCreateAutomationFull -> POST   /automations {full}                       invalidate -> list
  [x] useUpdateAutomationFull -> PUT    /automations/{id} {full}                  invalidate -> list + detail(id)
All 12 ported. SI preserved (no unit-bearing fields in this domain). Create/update bodies
are id-free by type (sealed step hierarchies carry no id/automation_id/step_id), so the
strict DisallowUnknownFields backend can never 400 them — locked by golden + contract tests.

